# Cloudflare Pages — global security headers (Phase 7 2차 DevOps)
#
# 적용 범위: 모든 경로 (/*).
#
# 헤더 설명:
#   - HSTS                          : 2년 + subdomain + preload (samhan-air.com 전 sub 적용)
#   - Content-Security-Policy        : self + Vite 의 inline script/style 허용 + samhan-air.com 백엔드 connect-src
#   - X-Frame-Options                : SAMEORIGIN (clickjacking 방어 — DENY 는 미리보기 iframe 충돌)
#   - Referrer-Policy                : strict-origin-when-cross-origin (URL path 누설 회피)
#   - X-Content-Type-Options         : nosniff (MIME sniffing 차단)
#   - Permissions-Policy             : camera/microphone/geolocation 미사용
#
# 운영 주의:
#   CSP 는 카카오 우편번호 (//t1.kakaocdn.net) + html2canvas (cdnjs.cloudflare.com) 를
#   script-src 에 명시 — index.html 의 외부 스크립트 의존과 1:1 정합.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://t1.kakaocdn.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' data: https:; connect-src 'self' https://*.samhan-air.com; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
